+The cores are `goal`, `dispatch`, `decision-capture`, `spec-gate`, `completion`, `mcp-route-guard`, `overlay-guard`, `env-secret-guard`, `permission-policy`, `post-edit-quality`, `classifier-injection-screen` and `ask-surface`. The git cores are `git-hooks-check`, `git-preflight`, `git-message-gate`, `git-live-follow`, `git-primary-reconcile` and `git-worktree-guard`. The rest are `session-cleanup`, `session-lifecycle`, `session-handover`, `skill-advisor`, `task-dispatch`, `directive-lifecycle`, `dist-freshness` and `codex-global-hooks-check`, plus `shared` for the helpers they all use.
 
